  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A constant resultant force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> acts on a body of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> that is initially at rest. The force is applied for a duration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span>. Which of the following is a correct expression for the final kinetic energy of the body?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F^{2} t^{2}}{M}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F^{2} t^{2}}{2 M}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F t^{2}}{2 M}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F^{2} t}{2 M}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
  },
